\newlabel{fig:safety_actual_z83}{{3}{10}{Continuous-phase Callisto at $z=83$, 1600-ppm spread and matched gains. Full-event occupancy envelopes show PI reaching zero and Fuzzy retaining positive reserve. The dotted line marks PI's first guard. Physical-minus-data phase reveals guard-induced progress loss; both columns use common axis ranges. This finite delayed execution supports the mechanism and is separate from the zero-delay all-time proof}{figure.caption.12}{}}
